1
00:00:59,342 --> 00:01:04,005
[Apocalypse Log 2]

2
00:01:27,375 --> 00:01:28,708
You...

3
00:01:30,416 --> 00:01:31,832
Who are you?

4
00:01:31,832 --> 00:01:33,458
What did you do to me?

5
00:01:44,750 --> 00:01:46,921
I'm your savior.

6
00:01:49,542 --> 00:01:51,667
If it weren't for me, you'd be dead.

7
00:02:05,292 --> 00:02:07,667
I'm the one who bandaged your wounds.

8
00:02:08,743 --> 00:02:11,368
If I wanted to hurt you,
I wouldn't have waited until now.

9
00:02:11,368 --> 00:02:13,534
I didn't need you to save me.

10
00:02:14,218 --> 00:02:16,843
What's your motive for saving me?

11
00:02:18,417 --> 00:02:20,333
What motive could I have?

12
00:02:20,333 --> 00:02:22,307
Even if it were a wounded kitten or puppy,

13
00:02:22,307 --> 00:02:24,292
I'd save it if I could.

14
00:02:24,292 --> 00:02:26,621
Let alone a living person like you.

15
00:02:30,968 --> 00:02:34,523
Don't think you can
get any information from me.

16
00:02:42,134 --> 00:02:44,542
I'll just assume your brain is damaged, too.

17
00:02:44,542 --> 00:02:46,209
I won't hold it against you.

18
00:03:00,384 --> 00:03:02,301
Since I've brought you back,

19
00:03:02,301 --> 00:03:04,593
I'll take responsibility for you.

20
00:03:04,593 --> 00:03:05,801
Don't worry.

21
00:03:05,801 --> 00:03:07,884
This is my secret camp.

22
00:03:07,884 --> 00:03:10,051
No one else will come here.

23
00:03:16,093 --> 00:03:18,676
It's easy to die in the apocalypse.

24
00:03:18,676 --> 00:03:21,124
If you really didn't want to live...

25
00:03:23,551 --> 00:03:26,343
then how did you get these injuries?

26
00:04:06,417 --> 00:04:08,218
We're running out of food.

27
00:04:08,218 --> 00:04:11,176
You two should discuss it the next few days.

28
00:04:11,176 --> 00:04:13,125
It's time to head out.

29
00:04:13,125 --> 00:04:14,716
Now that we have new equipment,

30
00:04:14,716 --> 00:04:16,009
maybe we can go farther

31
00:04:16,009 --> 00:04:17,134
and find some good stuff.

32
00:04:17,134 --> 00:04:18,509
Yeah.

33
00:04:18,509 --> 00:04:20,843
This hunting bow is very powerful.

34
00:04:20,843 --> 00:04:23,968
It'd be great if we all had one.

35
00:04:25,051 --> 00:04:27,384
All right. I'll look into it later.

36
00:04:31,718 --> 00:04:33,676
Perfect.

37
00:04:33,676 --> 00:04:36,042
Before we leave, I'll go reinforce the traps.

38
00:04:36,042 --> 00:04:38,042
Then I'll find some wild fruits
for Grandma Qiu.

39
00:04:53,915 --> 00:04:55,375
I won't be back for lunch.

40
00:04:55,375 --> 00:04:57,208
I've brought some dry rations.

41
00:04:57,208 --> 00:05:00,259
Okay. Li Ming and I will work on the plan.

42
00:05:00,259 --> 00:05:02,021
We'll set out in three days.

43
00:05:02,021 --> 00:05:03,112
Sure.

44
00:05:03,112 --> 00:05:05,070
Be careful out there.

45
00:05:45,968 --> 00:05:47,500
It's not poison.

46
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:48,551
See for yourself.

47
00:05:48,551 --> 00:05:50,508
It's real anti-inflammatory medicine.

48
00:06:00,884 --> 00:06:02,259
Fine.

49
00:06:03,333 --> 00:06:06,917
Let me check your wounds
and change your bandages first.

50
00:06:26,917 --> 00:06:30,442
How did you get all these injuries?

51
00:06:30,442 --> 00:06:32,926
How did you end up in the woods?

52
00:06:32,926 --> 00:06:34,526
I was passing by while searching for supplies.

53
00:06:34,526 --> 00:06:36,552
I ran into a horde of zombies.

54
00:06:36,552 --> 00:06:38,969
I didn't expect a camp to be nearby.

55
00:06:40,968 --> 00:06:42,584
Then you're quite lucky.

56
00:06:42,584 --> 00:06:44,099
You ran into me.

57
00:06:46,690 --> 00:06:48,230
Barely.

58
00:06:54,259 --> 00:06:57,759
How long has this camp been established?

59
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,430
This place...

60
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:03,558
We all searched for a long time
before deciding on it.

61
00:07:04,593 --> 00:07:07,131
This area is easy to defend but hard to attack.

62
00:07:08,593 --> 00:07:12,059
Your companions are quite capable.

63
00:07:13,841 --> 00:07:17,546
Everyone gives their all to survive.

64
00:07:26,875 --> 00:07:28,843
I've also researched many safety measures.

65
00:07:28,843 --> 00:07:31,498
I even intercepted three zombies yesterday.

66
00:07:35,375 --> 00:07:38,468
You're quite desperate to survive, too.

67
00:07:38,468 --> 00:07:40,478
You must really want to live.

68
00:07:41,801 --> 00:07:44,093
So, why didn't you ask me for help?

69
00:07:44,093 --> 00:07:45,930
Instead, you tried to drive me away.

70
00:07:47,676 --> 00:07:50,460
Who knew if you wanted to hurt or save me?

71
00:07:55,593 --> 00:07:59,093
Now, you know I'm not a bad person, right?

72
00:08:05,926 --> 00:08:07,218
Don't move.

73
00:09:08,509 --> 00:09:11,009
The wound is still a little inflamed.

74
00:09:11,009 --> 00:09:13,009
You need anti-inflammatory meds to heal faster.

75
00:09:30,509 --> 00:09:31,509
That's more like it.

76
00:09:31,509 --> 00:09:33,468
Why make things hard for yourself?

77
00:09:35,259 --> 00:09:37,218
Let go.

78
00:09:37,218 --> 00:09:38,801
Let go!

79
00:09:40,968 --> 00:09:42,926
What are you doing?

80
00:09:42,926 --> 00:09:44,593
To survive in this apocalypse,

81
00:09:44,593 --> 00:09:47,502
you must be wary of more than just zombies.

82
00:09:50,208 --> 00:09:52,752
I can tell who's good and who's bad.

83
00:09:52,752 --> 00:09:55,009
I know you're not a bad person.

84
00:09:58,093 --> 00:09:59,926
But you're not a good one either.

85
00:10:11,676 --> 00:10:13,468
No dinner for you tonight.

86
00:10:13,468 --> 00:10:15,509
Get some rest and recover.

87
00:10:22,051 --> 00:10:23,502
What a jerk.

88
00:10:35,718 --> 00:10:37,718
All he does is talk tough.

89
00:12:26,509 --> 00:12:29,131
This time, we're going
to the school in the east.

90
00:12:29,131 --> 00:12:30,133
Lin Zai.

91
00:12:30,133 --> 00:12:32,625
Are you sure there are still supplies there?

92
00:12:32,625 --> 00:12:33,793
Yes.

93
00:12:33,793 --> 00:12:37,418
But we were attacked by zombies back then.

94
00:12:38,634 --> 00:12:41,009
The nearby areas have been picked clean.

95
00:12:41,009 --> 00:12:43,093
We have to take the risk this time.

96
00:12:44,884 --> 00:12:46,176
All right.

97
00:12:46,801 --> 00:12:48,551
I remember the layout of the school.

98
00:12:48,551 --> 00:12:50,083
But we still have to be extremely careful.

99
00:12:50,083 --> 00:12:52,416
I've prepared everything we need.

100
00:12:53,884 --> 00:12:56,342
I've also reinforced and checked
the traps around the camp.

101
00:12:56,342 --> 00:12:57,967
Grandma Qiu's safety is guaranteed.

102
00:12:57,967 --> 00:12:59,634
Okay, let's head out immediately.

103
00:12:59,634 --> 00:13:02,292
If anything unusual happens,
withdraw immediately.

104
00:13:02,292 --> 00:13:03,459
Okay.

105
00:13:10,801 --> 00:13:12,676
Are there zombies?

106
00:14:06,542 --> 00:14:08,759
You're not dead.

107
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:11,051
I'm here to take back my things.

108
00:14:11,051 --> 00:14:12,301
Sorry.

109
00:14:12,301 --> 00:14:15,176
Finders keepers. It's ours now.

110
00:14:23,467 --> 00:14:24,977
Don't come any closer.

111
00:14:27,301 --> 00:14:29,640
Don't move. Stay back.

112
00:14:50,467 --> 00:14:54,009
Return my backpack exactly as it was.

113
00:14:55,509 --> 00:14:58,467
I know you won't hurt me.

114
00:14:58,467 --> 00:15:01,000
I won't hurt any of you.

115
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,208
As long as you return what's mine.

116
00:15:04,134 --> 00:15:06,384
But if you refuse,

117
00:15:07,384 --> 00:15:09,229
you're forcing my hand.

118
00:15:22,675 --> 00:15:24,259
Give it all back to him.

119
00:15:26,634 --> 00:15:28,175
What is this junk?

120
00:15:38,884 --> 00:15:41,967
The watch on your wrist is mine, too.

121
00:15:50,925 --> 00:15:53,583
It was my idea to take your things.

122
00:15:53,583 --> 00:15:55,458
But I also saved your life.

123
00:15:57,167 --> 00:15:58,356
Let's call it even.

124
00:15:58,356 --> 00:15:59,973
You can go.

125
00:16:18,465 --> 00:16:19,467
Guang Qi.

126
00:16:19,467 --> 00:16:21,091
Calling HQ.

127
00:16:21,091 --> 00:16:22,333
<i>Signal lost.</i>

128
00:16:22,333 --> 00:16:24,882
<i>Unable to establish a stable connection.</i>

129
00:16:24,882 --> 00:16:27,174
Check operational status of other core modules.

130
00:16:27,174 --> 00:16:28,216
<i>Network unavailable.</i>

131
00:16:28,216 --> 00:16:30,498
<i>Location module precision dropping.</i>

132
00:16:32,007 --> 00:16:34,424
<i>Physiological module
detected surface trauma on user,</i>

133
00:16:34,424 --> 00:16:36,167
<i>and signs of mild infection.</i>

134
00:16:36,167 --> 00:16:37,799
<i>Sample Escort Protocol updated.</i>

135
00:16:37,799 --> 00:16:40,117
<i>Immune target confirmed.</i>

136
00:17:49,604 --> 00:17:51,366
[Quanhe School]

137
00:19:02,174 --> 00:19:03,174
Chen.

138
00:19:03,174 --> 00:19:04,674
Li.

139
00:19:04,674 --> 00:19:06,007
I'm sorry.

140
00:19:07,716 --> 00:19:09,591
I shouldn't have lied to you.

141
00:19:09,591 --> 00:19:11,799
But I really didn't know he would turn on us.

142
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:12,966
It's all my fault.

143
00:19:12,966 --> 00:19:14,799
You can hit me if you want.

144
00:19:27,591 --> 00:19:29,091
Let's forget about it this time.

145
00:19:29,091 --> 00:19:30,466
We checked him that day.

146
00:19:30,466 --> 00:19:32,591
That man really hadn't been bitten by a zombie.

147
00:19:32,591 --> 00:19:35,382
But we still left him for dead.

148
00:19:35,382 --> 00:19:37,882
We really didn't have to be so heartless.

149
00:19:37,882 --> 00:19:40,340
We could have left him some food and medicine.

150
00:19:40,340 --> 00:19:42,965
Lin Zai, you did the right thing.

151
00:19:42,965 --> 00:19:45,882
This incident serves as a reminder to us.

152
00:19:45,882 --> 00:19:49,549
We strive to survive, not just so we can live,

153
00:19:49,549 --> 00:19:52,497
but so that all of humanity can survive.

154
00:19:54,174 --> 00:19:56,880
If you must apologize,

155
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,499
then carry more supplies.

156
00:20:04,132 --> 00:20:06,215
Why are you looking at me?

157
00:20:06,215 --> 00:20:09,049
I'm not helping you this time.

158
00:20:09,881 --> 00:20:10,882
I'm good.

159
00:20:10,882 --> 00:20:13,215
Li, I just saw a few bottles
of the hard liquor you like.

160
00:20:13,215 --> 00:20:15,542
I'll carry a few for you to make it up to you.

161
00:20:15,542 --> 00:20:16,550
All right!

162
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:19,106
Two bottles at most.
Prioritize the essential supplies.

163
00:20:19,106 --> 00:20:20,481
I know.

164
00:20:21,875 --> 00:20:23,571
Mind your own business.

165
00:20:39,549 --> 00:20:41,101
Run!

166
00:20:43,215 --> 00:20:45,059
Guys, run!

167
00:20:47,415 --> 00:20:49,083
Run!

